---
// Engelsk oversættelse af cookiepolitikken; den danske side (src/pages/cookiepolitik.astro) er kilden og gælder ved forskelle.
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const site = Astro.site!;
---
<Base
  lang="en"
  title="Cookie policy | Nem Inventar"
  description="Cookie policy for Nem Inventar ApS. We do not use cookies for analytics, marketing or tracking."
  alternates={[
    { hreflang: 'da', href: new URL(base + 'cookiepolitik/', site).href },
    { hreflang: 'en', href: new URL(base + 'en/cookies/', site).href },
  ]}>
  <article class="legal wrap">
    <h1>Cookie policy</h1>
    <p>This is an English translation. If the English and the Danish version differ, the <a href={`${base}cookiepolitik/`} hreflang="da">Danish version</a> applies.</p>
    <p class="upd">Last updated: October 2026</p>

    <h2>In short</h2>
    <p>neminventar.dk is a simple, static website. We do <strong>not</strong> use cookies for analytics, marketing or tracking, and we do not share your data with advertising networks. That is also why there is no cookie consent banner.</p>

    <h2>What are cookies?</h2>
    <p>Cookies are small text files that can be stored on your device when you visit a website — typically to remember settings or measure traffic.</p>

    <h2>Cookies on this site</h2>
    <p>We do not set any cookies for analytics or marketing. If your browser stores technical data, it is solely so that the site can be displayed correctly.</p>
    <h2>External services</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Fonts</strong> are hosted on our own domain — no data is sent to third-party font services.</li>
      <li><strong>The contact form</strong> sends the information you fill in yourself to us (via our data processor), so that we can reply. The processing is described in our <a href={`${base}en/privacy/`}>privacy policy</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Videos from YouTube</strong> (e.g. Rubio Monocoat's film on applying oil) are only loaded when you click play yourself. Until then, nothing is sent to YouTube. If you click, the video is fetched from youtube-nocookie.com, and YouTube/Google may process technical data about the playback under their own terms.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How to control cookies</h2>
    <p>You can always delete or block cookies in your browser settings (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge).</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Nem Inventar ApS</strong><br />
      Email: <a href="mailto:kontakt@neminventar.dk">kontakt@neminventar.dk</a><br />
      Phone: +45 42 42 26 84<br />
      Address: Mågevej 73, st., DK-2400 Copenhagen NV, Denmark
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>

<!-- Styles: .legal i site.css (fælles for de juridiske sider) -->
